1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,672
Meet NeatSpace, a home cleaning platform for Lagos, Nigeria.

2
00:00:03,712 --> 00:00:07,395
Customers pick a service, choose a time, and book in minutes,

3
00:00:07,435 --> 00:00:10,997
while the owner runs the whole business from one dashboard.

4
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:15,863
The home page shows the rating, homes cleaned, and the next open slot.

5
00:00:15,903 --> 00:00:19,334
It explains the three steps to book, lists every service,

6
00:00:19,374 --> 00:00:21,648
and introduces your dedicated cleaner.

7
00:00:22,290 --> 00:00:26,351
On the Services page, every cleaning is priced upfront. Standard,

8
00:00:26,391 --> 00:00:27,991
Deep, Move In or Move Out,

9
00:00:28,031 --> 00:00:32,345
and Custom cleans each show a starting price, the estimated duration,

10
00:00:32,385 --> 00:00:34,111
and exactly what's included.

11
00:00:34,750 --> 00:00:38,886
How it works walks through the process, then explains confirmations,

12
00:00:38,926 --> 00:00:40,851
reminders, live status tracking,

13
00:00:40,891 --> 00:00:43,307
and the deposit and cancellation policy.

14
00:00:43,950 --> 00:00:47,336
The Reviews page collects honest feedback from real homes,

15
00:00:47,376 --> 00:00:51,825
and the referral program gives five thousand naira to both you and a friend.

16
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:55,634
To book, customers sign in or create a free account.

17
00:00:55,674 --> 00:00:59,774
The booking wizard starts with the home: type, bedrooms, bathrooms,

18
00:00:59,814 --> 00:01:01,381
condition, and pets. Next,

19
00:01:01,421 --> 00:01:04,533
they build the cleaning with a service and add-ons,

20
00:01:04,573 --> 00:01:06,201
and the price updates live.

21
00:01:07,180 --> 00:01:08,762
They can upload room photos,

22
00:01:08,802 --> 00:01:12,064
enter the address and service area to see any travel fee,

23
00:01:12,104 --> 00:01:15,481
then choose from time slots the cleaner can genuinely work.

24
00:01:17,547 --> 00:01:21,625
Finally, they add contact details, how often they'd like a cleaning,

25
00:01:21,665 --> 00:01:23,261
and an optional promo code,

26
00:01:23,301 --> 00:01:26,168
then review everything and pay a secure deposit.

27
00:01:28,313 --> 00:01:32,264
Every booking gets its own page, where customers track its status,

28
00:01:32,304 --> 00:01:35,166
reschedule, pay the balance, and leave a review.

29
00:01:35,206 --> 00:01:38,371
The footer links to the rescheduling, terms, privacy,

30
00:01:38,411 --> 00:01:39,580
and refund policies.

31
00:01:41,723 --> 00:01:44,022
Now the owner side. After signing in,

32
00:01:44,062 --> 00:01:48,129
the Overview gives a daily summary: today's bookings and revenue,

33
00:01:48,169 --> 00:01:51,731
upcoming jobs, pending payments, ratings, and follow-ups.

34
00:01:52,373 --> 00:01:55,129
Bookings lists every job, filtered by status.

35
00:01:55,169 --> 00:01:58,795
Opening one shows the customer, the home details, payments,

36
00:01:58,835 --> 00:02:02,275
and the timeline, so the owner can move the job forward.

37
00:02:02,913 --> 00:02:05,916
The calendar shows the day, week, or month at a glance,

38
00:02:05,956 --> 00:02:09,124
and the owner can block off time when they're unavailable.

39
00:02:09,763 --> 00:02:13,334
Customers tracks every client, their spending and preferences,

40
00:02:13,374 --> 00:02:16,827
with one-click reminders for follow-ups and unpaid bookings.

41
00:02:17,463 --> 00:02:21,328
Payments shows collected deposits, outstanding balances, refunds,

42
00:02:21,368 --> 00:02:22,650
and scheduled revenue.

43
00:02:23,293 --> 00:02:25,387
Analytics charts revenue over time,

44
00:02:25,427 --> 00:02:28,861
highlights insights like the busiest day and top service,

45
00:02:28,901 --> 00:02:31,787
and breaks down capacity, services, and add-ons.

46
00:02:32,423 --> 00:02:36,103
Reviews and issues gathers ratings and problems to resolve,

47
00:02:36,143 --> 00:02:39,445
and Notifications logs every new booking and payment.

48
00:02:40,083 --> 00:02:44,611
In Settings, the owner controls the business profile, working hours,

49
00:02:44,651 --> 00:02:49,245
deposit, fees, cancellation policy, services, add-ons, service areas,

50
00:02:49,285 --> 00:02:52,267
and promo codes. Changes go live immediately.

51
00:02:52,903 --> 00:02:55,530
NeatSpace. A cleaner home, without the hassle.
